                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc6369ff-4e87-3bd4-b228-9a0d73b11fb2",
                        "entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. направление в движении или развитии чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2116a499-8572-3a07-b5ab-52ccc8aba7d7",
                        "entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предвзятая, необъективная, односторонняя мысль, не вытекающая из существа дела, но навязываемая кем-либо кому-либо; тенденциозность"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9efe808-2fa9-3854-a20a-d7cb5c9f4fab",
                        "entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "стремление, намерение свойственное кому-либо или чему-либо; направленность во взглядах или действиях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a057eb1-1cf2-4b88-9147-dc023d27e651",
                                "sense_id": "a9efe808-2fa9-3854-a20a-d7cb5c9f4fab",
                                "text": "Гламуризация публичной сферы, политики, культуры — ещё одна ведущая тенденция социальной и культурной жизни страны последних лет"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5d0811f2-9385-3e13-94dd-ff9a5de8559f",
                        "entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филол. предвзятая идея, навязываемая читателю, зрителю, и не вытекающая органически из развития художественных образов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dd0a7a5f-2121-4dfc-a39c-f4a45067041c",
                        "source_entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "target_lang_word": "tendency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tendency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af9b5d84-2ba4-3dc2-975f-2ed35bd1ae7e",
                                        "entry_id": "24c45fd7-7c82-3c92-b9e4-d15b01766ebc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A likelihood of behaving in a particular way or going in a particular direction; a tending toward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4deeed7a-8845-4c8f-981f-7163062e1e47",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b5d84-2ba4-3dc2-975f-2ed35bd1ae7e",
                                                "text": "Denim has a tendency to fade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02962f1c-1f9d-46ba-932c-0d3801fa2e59",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b5d84-2ba4-3dc2-975f-2ed35bd1ae7e",
                                                "text": "I have a tendency to get bored after the first half an hour of a movie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c4ffd0b-20cd-43c4-8021-015812ed41e1",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b5d84-2ba4-3dc2-975f-2ed35bd1ae7e",
                                                "text": "There's a common tendency among first-game visitors to a casino to bet overcautiously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34feefbb-3b3f-4689-b941-c4b7c2641ffa",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b5d84-2ba4-3dc2-975f-2ed35bd1ae7e",
                                                "text": "In some details, Britannia shows the trend towards American practice that was already apparent in later L.M.S.R. designs—for example, in regard to the mounting of the cab—and this tendency has been further developed in the footwalk with deep sideplating, mounted on the boiler, in place of the framing and splashers usual in British practice in the past."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f87df18-1dbd-3bc1-9b71-75de1190f169",
                                        "entry_id": "24c45fd7-7c82-3c92-b9e4-d15b01766ebc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organised unit or faction within a larger political organisation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d752205a-cc1c-4ed0-b070-41e36077d419",
                                                "sense_id": "9f87df18-1dbd-3bc1-9b71-75de1190f169",
                                                "text": "Mao launched the struggle against the vulgar materialist tendency within the party as early as 1937."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "099d7751-ab0c-4928-826a-678ffe76ed1e",
                                                "sense_id": "9f87df18-1dbd-3bc1-9b71-75de1190f169",
                                                "text": "In stark contrast to the Europeanist tendency within the party and the Suez Group, this group had a short history."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af05b38f-5e49-42eb-80aa-59e97b1d7311",
                                                "sense_id": "9f87df18-1dbd-3bc1-9b71-75de1190f169",
                                                "text": "It reinforced the position of the conformist tendency within the party, since the majority of the candidates were old politicians, many of them members of Papandreou's centre-left CU faction back in the mid-1960s."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5088b468-8990-4a70-be79-fac98f276876",
                        "source_entry_id": "c44131b0-7906-34b3-99d9-f8727999afba",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tendenz",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tendenz",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                        "entry_id": "fb245199-5242-32f3-9a24-30a4f180b53d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hang, Neigung, Streben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e48834c1-2e2e-43ca-a189-7c63a1b00a78",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "Er hat eine Tendenz zum Schielen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "520aa684-32a8-41da-9427-67ca157edf38",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "Wie immer ist die Tendenz beim Benzinpreis steigend."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e203ec2-387e-4b11-8a26-304e197dafd5",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "Die Zahl der Neuerkrankungen bleibt mit leicht fallender Tendenz auf niedrigem Niveau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b01459b9-e2af-482f-8925-db40af96ed72",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "Sie hat so eine Tendenz bockig zu reagieren, aber Sie sind ja Diplomat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50b5587a-2336-4680-b8fb-c73bf8bfbfeb",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "„Weil das so ist, gelangt die Sprachwissenschaft, wenn sie den Gründen, aktuellen Tendenzen und allgmeinen Gesetzlichkeiten der Sprachentwicklung nachgeht, vielfach zu anderen Schlüssen als die Sprachkritik, die jene Einzelheiten eher punktuell ins Visier nimmt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "695e0463-fe9b-49f1-80e6-be6847416cf9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6f6be00-ba4b-377c-85d1-85d52998a1da",
                                                "text": "„Die von Gewinnmaximierung oder – unfreundlicher ausgedrückt – von Profitgier getriebene Tendenz zur Monopolisierung gehört ironischerweise von Anfang an zum Wesen des Konkurrenzkapitalismus.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4994bb03-23e0-3340-91af-c84831204fca",
                                        "entry_id": "fb245199-5242-32f3-9a24-30a4f180b53d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Absicht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7806255e-057c-4d7c-a817-78142b5d4cb4",
                                                "sense_id": "4994bb03-23e0-3340-91af-c84831204fca",
                                                "text": "Er beugte sich vor, voll der geheimen Tendenz dem Vater unerwartet Neues über den Sohn zu sagen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef468998-3229-4f3d-891c-2b2e130d536f",
                                                "sense_id": "4994bb03-23e0-3340-91af-c84831204fca",
                                                "text": "„Nur eine Form der Tendenz ist dem Künstler nicht erlaubt, die der Schwarz-Weiß-Zeichnung, die den Menschen der einen Seite als Teufel bildet, den der andern als Engel.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
